{"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/yubikit\/loggingguide"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"metadata":{"role":"article","roleHeading":"Article","title":"Logging","modules":[{"name":"YubiKit"}]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Choose YubiKit’s log level and backend with "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/Logging\/configure(logLevel:factory:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"sections":[],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/LoggingGuide","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit"]]},"seeAlsoSections":[{"title":"Preparing your project","identifiers":["doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/GettingStarted","doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/Logging"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Preparing-your-project"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"No setup is required. YubiKit defaults to ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"debug"},{"text":" on stdout when compiled with ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"DEBUG"},{"text":",","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"or ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"info"},{"text":" on stderr otherwise. You can override either default:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["import YubiKit","import Logging","","\/\/ Show warnings and errors.","Logging.configure(logLevel: .warning)","","\/\/ Use your preferred backend.","Logging.configure(logLevel: .debug) { label in","    StreamLogHandler.standardOutput(label: label)","}","","\/\/ Turn logging off.","Logging.configure { _ in SwiftLogNoOpLogHandler() }","","\/\/ Restore defaults.","Logging.configure()"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Add "},{"type":"reference","