clude account names and credential identifiers.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Trace logs can include PINs, credentials, and cryptographic keys. Protect or redact logs before sharing them.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"Warning","style":"warning","type":"aside"},{"level":3,"text":"Custom backends","anchor":"Custom-backends","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Labels identify categories, such as "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"com.yubico.YubiKit.OATH"},{"type":"text","text":" or "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"com.yubico.YubiKit.FIDO"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Metadata carries details such as byte counts and error codes; the default backend displays"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"these as "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"key=value"},{"type":"text","text":" pairs. Message wording and metadata keys are not a stable API."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Your backend controls formatting, storage, and export. YubiKit does not retain log messages.","type":"text"}]}],"kind":"content"}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"kind":"article","references":{"doc://yubikit-swift.YubiKit/documentation/YubiKit/Logging":{"kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Logging","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/yubikit\/logging","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Logging","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/Logging","type":"topic","title":"Logging","abstract":[{"text":"Configures logging for YubiKit connections and sessions.","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol"},"doc://yubikit-swift.YubiKit/documentation/YubiKit":{"kind":"symbol","images":[{"identifier":"documentation-header.png","type":"icon"}],"url":"\/documentation\/yubikit","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit